---
/* PostHog init, as one component rather than three copies of a script.

   There is no shared root layout on this site — index.astro, about.astro and
   CaseStudyLayout.astro each own their own `<!doctype html>` shell (see Stack
   in CLAUDE.md), the same reason Footer.astro is imported in three places.
   Adding a fourth top-level page means rendering this in its `<head>` too, or
   that page goes unmeasured.

   No markup and no props: it exists purely to carry the script. */
---

<script>
	import { initAnalytics, initInteractionTracking } from './analytics';

	initAnalytics();
	initInteractionTracking();
</script>
